  "bodyHash": "9126ca114c619563",
  "content": "\n\n<h3>&nbsp;<img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://coolsimulations.net/wp-content/uploads/2019/03/morethanapickaxe_logo_HD.png\" alt=\"More Than A Pickaxe\" width=\"1024\" height=\"512\"></h3>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:36px\"><strong>MoreThanAPickaxe 總覽：</strong></span></h2>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">MoreThanAPickaxe 透過新增一把萬用工具來提升《我的世界》的生存體驗（剪羊毛除外）。您不再需要為了挖掘不同材質而更換工具。這把名為「斧鏨」的工具集鎬子、戰斧、劍、鋤頭與鏟子於一身。</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>MoreThanAPickaxe 社群：</strong></span></span></h3>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">作者本人以及更多ThanAPickaxe 的玩家可以在我們的 <a href=\"https://discord.gg/7DDsHfQ\" rel=\"nofollow\">Discord 伺服器</a> 找到我們。此外，如果您偏好使用 Guilded 而非 Discord，也可以加入 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.guilded.gg%252fi%252fWkn138B2\" rel=\"nofollow\">Guilded 伺服器</a>。<br></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>MoreThanAPickaxe 需求：</strong></span></span></h3>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">MoreThanAPickaxe 必須安裝 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/survivalplus\" rel=\"nofollow\">SurvivalPlus</a> 才能運作，無法單獨使用。 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/more-than-a-pickaxe-fabric\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fabric 版本請點擊此處下載</a>.</span></p>\n<h3><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>主要功能：</strong></span></h3>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>斧鏨種類：</strong></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"padding-left:30px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">木製斧鏨<br></span></li>\n<li style=\"padding-left:30px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">石製斧鏨<br></span></li>\n<li style=\"padding-left:30px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">鐵製斧鏨</span></li>\n<li style=\"padding-left:30px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">金製斧鏨</span></li>\n<li style=\"padding-left:30px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">鑽石斧鏨</span></li>\n<li style=\"padding-left:30px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">獄髓斧鏨（在所有版本中均防火）</span></li>\n<li style=\"padding-left:30px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">青銅斧鏨</span></li>\n<li style=\"padding-left:30px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">鈦製斧鏨</span></li>\n<li style=\"padding-left:30px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">鋼製斧鏨（僅當其他模組新增鋼錠時方可製作）</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>MoreThanAPickaxe 模組相容性：</strong></span></h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>模組相容性總覽：</strong></span></h3>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">MoreThanAPickaxe 自 0.1.6 版起已支援超過 19 種不同的模組。但這代表什麼意思呢？簡而言之，針對這些選定的模組，MoreThanAPickaxe 會以相同的方式，為每個模組中的工具套裝新增一把對應的斧鏨。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>1.19：</strong></span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>翡翠斧鏨：</strong></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"padding-left:30px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">若安裝以下任一模組，將新增翡翠斧鏨</span></li>\n<li style=\"padding-left:90px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/gems-and-crystals\" rel=\"nofollow\">《寶石與水晶》</a>, <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/standard-materials\" rel=\"nofollow\">《標準材料》</a>, <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/simple-emerald-mod\" rel=\"nofollow\">《簡單翡翠模組》</a>, <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/easy-emerald-tools\" rel=\"nofollow\">《輕鬆翡翠工具》&nbsp;</a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fancytools\" rel=\"nofollow\">《精緻工具》</a><strong>, <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/exlines-emerald-equipment\" rel=\"nofollow\">《翡翠裝備》</a></strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>黑曜石斧鏨：</strong></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"padding-left:30px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">若安裝以下任一模組，將新增黑曜石斧鏨</span></li>\n<li style=\"padding-left:90px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/standard-materials\" rel=\"nofollow\">《標準材料》</a>, <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/obsidian-armor-and-tools\" rel=\"nofollow\">《黑曜石護甲與工具》&nbsp;</a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fancytools\" rel=\"nofollow\">《精緻工具》</a><strong>, <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/obsidian-equipment\" rel=\"nofollow\">《黑曜石裝備》</a></strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>紅寶石斧鏨：</strong></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"padding-left:30px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">若安裝以下任一模組，將新增紅寶石斧鏨</span></li>\n<li style=\"padding-left:90px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/gems-and-crystals\" rel=\"nofollow\">《寶石與水晶》</a>, <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/simple-emerald-mod\" rel=\"nofollow\">《簡單翡翠模組》</a></span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/gems-and-crystals\" rel=\"nofollow\">《寶石與水晶》</a>：</strong></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"padding-left:30px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">新增紫水晶、藍寶石、黃玉與石英斧鏨</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/lumberjack\" rel=\"nofollow\">《伐木工》</a>：</strong></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"padding-left:30px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">斧鏨可無需設定即可砍倒整棵樹</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/gobber\" rel=\"nofollow\">《戈伯》</a>：</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><br></strong></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"padding-left:30px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">新增戈伯、下界與終界斧鏨。<br></span></li>\n<li style=\"padding-left:30px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">戈伯與下界斧鏨：</span>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"padding-left:30px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">可砍倒整棵樹，並可按住 Shift 鍵摧毀單一格樹方塊<br></span></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li style=\"padding-left:30px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">終界斧鏨：</span>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"padding-left:30px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">可砍倒整棵樹，並可按住 Shift 鍵摧毀單一格樹方塊</span></li>\n<li style=\"padding-left:30px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">可發射無限箭矢</span></li>\n<li style=\"padding-left:30px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">可放置無限火把</span></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/the-aether\" rel=\"nofollow\">《天堂》</a>：<br></strong></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"padding-left:30px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">新增重力石、聖光石、天根木、女武神與扎尼特斧鏨，並附有對應的特殊能力</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/better-combat-by-daedelus\" rel=\"nofollow\">《更佳戰鬥》</a>：<br></strong></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"padding-left:30px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">新增戰斧攻擊動畫<br></span></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>1.17.1-1.18.2（已停止維護）：</strong></span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>翡翠斧鏨：</strong></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"padding-left:30px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">若安裝以下任一模組，將新增翡翠斧鏨</span></li>\n<li style=\"padding-left:90px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/gems-and-crystals\" rel=\"nofollow\">《寶石與水晶》</a>, <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/standard-materials\" rel=\"nofollow\">《標準材料》</a>, <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/simple-emerald-mod\" rel=\"nofollow\">《簡單翡翠模組》</a>, <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/easy-emerald-tools\" rel=\"nofollow\">《輕鬆翡翠工具》&nbsp;</a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fancytools\" rel=\"nofollow\">《精緻工具》</a><strong>, <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/exlines-emerald-equipment\" rel=\"nofollow\">《翡翠裝備》</a></strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>黑曜石斧鏨：</strong></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"padding-left:30px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">若安裝以下任一模組，將新增黑曜石斧鏨</span></li>\n<li style=\"padding-left:90px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/standard-materials\" rel=\"nofollow\">《標準材料》</a>, <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/obsidian-armor-and-tools\" rel=\"nofollow\">《黑曜石護甲與工具》&nbsp;</a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fancytools\" rel=\"nofollow\">《精緻工具》</a><strong>, <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/obsidian-equipment\" rel=\"nofollow\">《黑曜石裝備》</a></strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>紅寶石斧鏨：</strong></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"padding-left:30px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">若安裝以下任一模組，將新增紅寶石斧鏨</span></li>\n<li style=\"padding-left:90px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/gems-and-crystals\" rel=\"nofollow\">《寶石與水晶》</a>, <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/simple-emerald-mod\" rel=\"nofollow\">《簡單翡翠模組》</a></span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/gems-and-crystals\" rel=\"nofollow\">《寶石與水晶》</a>：</strong></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"padding-left:30px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">新增紫水晶、藍寶石、黃玉與石英斧鏨</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/lumberjack\" rel=\"nofollow\">《伐木工》</a>：</strong></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"padding-left:30px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">斧鏨可無需設定即可砍倒整棵樹</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/gobber\" rel=\"nofollow\">《戈伯》</a>：</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><br></strong></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"padding-left:30px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">新增戈伯、下界與終界斧鏨。<br></span></li>\n<li style=\"padding-left:30px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">戈伯與下界斧鏨：</span>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"padding-left:30px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">可砍倒整棵樹，並可按住 Shift 鍵摧毀單一格樹方塊<br></span></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li style=\"padding-left:30px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">終界斧鏨：</span>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"padding-left:30px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">可砍倒整棵樹，並可按住 Shift 鍵摧毀單一格樹方塊</span></li>\n<li style=\"padding-left:30px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">可發射無限箭矢</span></li>\n<li style=\"padding-left:30px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">可放置無限火把</span></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>1.16.5（已停止維護）：</strong></span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>翡翠斧鏨：</strong></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"padding-left:30px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">若安裝以下任一模組，將新增翡翠斧鏨</span></li>\n<li style=\"padding-left:90px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/gems-and-crystals\" rel=\"nofollow\">《寶石與水晶》</a>, <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/standard-materials\" rel=\"nofollow\">《標準材料》</a>, <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/simple-emerald-mod\" rel=\"nofollow\">《簡單翡翠模組》</a>, <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/easy-emerald-tools\" rel=\"nofollow\">《輕鬆翡翠工具》</a></span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>黑曜石斧鏨：</strong></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"padding-left:30px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">若安裝以下任一模組，將新增黑曜石斧鏨</span></li>\n<li style=\"padding-left:90px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/standard-materials\" rel=\"nofollow\">《標準材料》</a>, <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/obsidian-armor-and-tools\" rel=\"nofollow\">《黑曜石護甲與工具》</a></span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>紅寶石斧鏨：</strong></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"padding-left:30px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">若安裝以下任一模組，將新增紅寶石斧鏨</span></li>\n<li style=\"padding-left:90px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/gems-and-crystals\" rel=\"nofollow\">《寶石與水晶》</a>, <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/simple-emerald-mod\" rel=\"nofollow\">《簡單翡翠模組》</a></span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/gems-and-crystals\" rel=\"nofollow\">《寶石與水晶》</a>：</strong></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"padding-left:30px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">新增紫水晶、藍寶石、黃玉與石英斧鏨</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/lumberjack\" rel=\"nofollow\">《伐木工》</a>：</strong></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"padding-left:30px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">斧鏨可無需設定即可砍倒整棵樹</span></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>1.15.2（已停止維護）：</strong></span></p>\n\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>獄髓斧鑿：</strong></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"padding-left:30px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">若使用以下任一模組，將新增獄髓斧鑿</span></li>\n<li style=\"padding-left:60px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/extended-nether-backport\" rel=\"nofollow\">Extended Nether Backport</a>, <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/future-mc\" rel=\"nofollow\">Future MC</a></span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>綠寶石斧鑿：</strong></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"padding-left:30px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">若使用以下任一模組，將新增綠寶石斧鑿</span></li>\n<li style=\"padding-left:90px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/gems-and-crystals\" rel=\"nofollow\">Gems and Crystals</a>, <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/standard-materials\" rel=\"nofollow\">Standard Materials</a></span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>黑曜石斧鑿：</strong></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"padding-left:30px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">若使用以下任一模組，將新增黑曜石斧鑿</span></li>\n<li style=\"padding-left:90px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/standard-materials\" rel=\"nofollow\">Standard Materials</a>, <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/obsidian-armor-and-tools\" rel=\"nofollow\">Obsidian Armor and Tools</a></span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/gems-and-crystals\" rel=\"nofollow\">Gems and Crystals</a>：</strong></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"padding-left:30px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">新增紫水晶、紅寶石、藍寶石、黃玉與石英斧鑿</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/lumberjack\" rel=\"nofollow\">Lumberjack</a>：</strong></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"padding-left:30px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">斧鑿無需配置即可砍倒整棵樹<br></span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/vulcanite\" rel=\"nofollow\">Vulcanite</a>：<br></strong></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"padding-left:30px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">新增伏爾坎石斧鑿</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/carbonado\" rel=\"nofollow\">Carbonado</a>：<br></strong></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"padding-left:30px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">新增碳納多斧鑿</span></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>1.14.4（已停止維護）：</strong></span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>綠寶石斧鑿：</strong></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"padding-left:30px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">若使用以下任一模組，將新增綠寶石斧鑿</span></li>\n<li style=\"padding-left:90px\"><span styl