strong></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"padding-left:30px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">若安裝以下任一模組，將新增黃玉斧鍘</span></li>\n<li style=\"padding-left:90px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/trigems\" rel=\"nofollow\">TriGems</a>, <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/gems-and-crystals\" rel=\"nofollow\">Gems and Crystals</a></span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>藍寶石斧鍘：</strong></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"padding-left:30px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">若安裝以下任一模組，將新增藍寶石斧鍘</span></li>\n<li style=\"padding-left:90px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/trigems\" rel=\"nofollow\">TriGems</a>, <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/gems-and-crystals\" rel=\"nofollow\">Gems and Crystals</a></span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmicdoodle8.com%252fmods%252fgalacticraft\" rel=\"nofollow\">Galacticraft / Galacticraft Planets</a></strong></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"padding-left:30px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">新增鋼製與德斯（Desh）斧鍘</span></li>\n<li style=\"padding-left:30px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">新增<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwiki.micdoodle8.com%252fwiki%252fSticky_Desh_Pickaxe\" rel=\"nofollow\">黏性德斯（Sticky Desh）</a>斧鍘</span></li>\n<li style=\"padding-left:30px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">斧鍘可用於採收<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwiki.micdoodle8.com%252fwiki%252fSlimeling_Egg\" rel=\"nofollow\">史萊姆蛋（Slimeling Eggs）</a></span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/gems-and-crystals\" rel=\"nofollow\">Gems and Crystals</a>：</strong></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"padding-left:30px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">新增紫水晶與石英斧鍘</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/lumberjack\" rel=\"nofollow\">Lumberjack</a>：</strong></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"padding-left:30px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">斧鍘無需設定即可砍伐整棵樹木<br></span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/vulcanite\" rel=\"nofollow\">Vulcanite</a>:<br></strong></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"padding-left:30px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">新增火山岩（Vulcanite）斧鍘</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/carbonado\" rel=\"nofollow\">Carbonado</a>:<br></strong></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"padding-left:30px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">新增碳鋯石（Carbonado）斧鍘</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/galaxite\" rel=\"nofollow\">Galaxite Ore</a>:<br></strong></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"padding-left:30px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">新增星銀礦（Galaxite）斧鍘</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/the-aether\" rel=\"nofollow\">The Aether</a>:<br></strong></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"padding-left:30px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">新增具有對應特殊能力的引力石（Gravitite）、聖石（Holystone）、天根木（Skyroot）、女武神（Valkyrie）與贊石（Zanite）斧鍘</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/hammer-time\" rel=\"nofollow\">Hammer Time</a>:<br></strong></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"padding-left:30px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">新增高密度斧鍘，具備 Hammer Time 的鎚子、鏟子、斧頭與鐮刀功能</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/extraplanets\" rel=\"nofollow\">ExtraPlanets</a>:</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><br></strong></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"padding-left:30px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">新增水銀、碳、鈾、鈀、紅寶石、鎂、水晶、白寶石、藍寶石、鋅、鎢、藍鑽石、紅鑽石、紫鑽石、黃鑽石與綠鑽石斧鍘<br></span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/gobber\" rel=\"nofollow\">Gobber</a>:</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><br></strong></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"padding-left:30px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">新增戈伯（Gobber）、下界與終界斧鍘。<br></span></li>\n<li style=\"padding-left:30px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">戈伯與下界斧鍘：</span>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"padding-left:30px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">右鍵點擊後提供 2 分鐘的夜視、水下呼吸與抗火效果</span></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li style=\"padding-left:30px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">終界斧鍘：</span>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"padding-left:30px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">右鍵點擊後提供 2 分鐘的夜視、水下呼吸與抗火效果</span></li>\n<li style=\"padding-left:30px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">可發射無限箭矢</span></li>\n<li style=\"padding-left:30px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">可放置無限火把</span>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"padding-left:30px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/future-mc\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>FutureMC</strong></a>（使用戈伯模組時）<strong>:</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><br></strong></span>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"padding-left:30px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">在下界放置靈魂火把<br></span></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li style=\"padding-left:30px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/aether\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>The Aether</strong></a>（使用戈伯模組時）<strong>:</strong><strong><br></strong></span></span>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"padding-left:30px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">在天域放置神靈火把</span></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li style=\"padding-left:30px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmicdoodle8.com%252fmods%252fgalacticraft\" rel=\"nofollow\">Galacticraft / Galacticraft Planets /</a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/gobber\" rel=\"nofollow\">ExtraPlanets</a>（使用戈伯模組時）<strong>:</strong><strong><br></strong></span></span>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"padding-left:30px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">在所有無法呼吸的星球／衛星上放置螢石火把<br></span></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/simply-platinum\" rel=\"nofollow\">Simply Platinum</a>：</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><br></strong></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"padding-left:30px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">新增鉑金斧鍘</span></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>1.10.2 與 1.11.2（已停止支援）：</strong></span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmicdoodle8.com%252fmods%252fgalacticraft\" rel=\"nofollow\">Galacticraft</a> / <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmicdoodle8.com%252fmods%252fgalacticraft\" rel=\"nofollow\">Galacticraft Planets</a>：</strong></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"padding-left:30px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">新增鋼製與德斯（Desh）斧鍘</span></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong><br></strong></span></p>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>支援語言：</strong></span></h3>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>英文（美國）</strong> - en_us</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>西班牙文／Espa&ntilde;ol（西班牙）</strong> - es_es<br></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>日文／日本語</strong> - ja_jp<br></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>俄文／Русский</strong> - ru_ru<br></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>簡體中文／简体中文</strong> - zh_cn<br></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>繁體中文／繁體中文</strong> - zh_tw</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>Minecraft 版本：</strong></span></h3>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">請勿要求將 MoreThanAPickaxe 移植至較舊的 Minecraft 版本。開發者 coolsim 計畫維護 Minecraft 版本（1.12 與 1.19），移植至 1.10 以前的版本耗時過長且回報不高。與其要求移植舊版模組，或許您可以查詢正在使用的舊模組是否可更新？coolsim 將在對應的 Forge 版本發布後，開始將 MoreThanAPickaxe 更新至 1.20，因此請勿提出此類請求。</span>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>授權與模組包：</strong></span></h3>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">歡迎在任何模組包中使用 MoreThanAPickaxe，但請務必註明作者為 coolsim。不得以任何形式重新散布 MoreThanAPickaxe。</span></p>",
